        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>4 1/2\" x 4 1/2\" x Square Corners Commercial Door Hinge</b>\r\n<p>Heavy duty steel commercial grade door hinge with 2 ball bearings and Non-Removable Pin (NRP). \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSecurity Non-Removable Hinge Pin for exterior outswing doors, prevents the hinge pins removal by vandals and thieves. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.134\" (Commercial Grade)</li>\r\n<li>2 Ball Bearings for Smooth Action</li>\r\n<li>Non-Removable Pin for Security</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 5</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Steel Hinge Pin</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Conforms to ANSI A8112 for Ball Bearing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackage with matching finish machine screws and wood screws. For use with both metal and wood  doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
